# T-1168: mu combinator — non-contractive union body
# A union containing a bare RecursiveRef μa.(a | Int) is non-contractive:
# the Union wrapper is NOT a guarding constructor, so the self-reference
# is not shielded. This must produce a type error (rejected at construction
# time by the contractiveness check in mu).
[@[mu a [or a Int]] 42]
=== error
non-contractive recursive type
